                                  <div id="productDescription_feature_div" class="celwidget pd_rd_w-vkBPE pd_rd_r-67RTND92GKWZQFWSF2SK pd_rd_wg-27MK9" data-feature-name="productDescription-3" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-c-content-id="productDescription-3" data-csa-c-slot-id="productDescription_feature_div" data-csa-c-asin="" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row="false" data-csa-c-id="xit6wa-fpqsam-efbd2h-ysbov" data-cel-widget="productDescription_feature_div">
                           <div>
      <div data-feature-name="productDescription" data-template-name="productDescription" id="productDescription_feature_div" class="a-row feature" data-cel-widget="productDescription_feature_div">    <div class="a-divider a-divider-section"><div class="a-divider-inner"></div></div>   <h2 class="default"> Product description  </h2>               <div id="productDescription" class="a-section a-spacing-small">       <!-- show up to 2 reviews by default -->
           <h3>    <span>Product Description</span>   </h3>        <p>    <span>Immerse into the audio when you wear the boAt Rockerz 460 Wireless Headphones. High-fidelity 40 mm drivers make every entertainment form enjoyable with the powerful audio output. From music to movies, boAt Signature Sound takes listening to the next level by adding a punch to the audio. Unwind after a tedious day or exercise with your favorite beats for company with the extensive playtime of up to 30 hours. Not just listening, upgrade your gaming experience too with the quick-switch button for BEAST™ mode that enables low-latency gaming. Along with eliminating lag, Rockerz 460 also takes out uncomfortable wear for the utmost audio relaxation. While the headband can be modified to your convenience using adaptive fit, the plush earcups minimize pressure on your ears for uninterrupted gaming sessions with your squad. Additionally, powered by ENx™ technology, these headphones cancel background sounds for increased calling comfort. Take calls while in a car, mall, or crowded workspace without moving from your spot. Dual pairing on the other hand makes hustling through your daily tasks a breeze. Switch between attending meetings on your laptop and answering calls on your smartphone. And, do it all wirelessly with Bluetooth v5.2 connectivity. Featuring convenient control buttons, these headphones also make it easy to take calls and play or pause the audio. To tick off tasks like a pro, Rockerz 460 is integrated with voice assistant activation. Get local weather updates, open the navigation app while traveling, set reminders, and do more with voice commands.</span>    </p>          <h3>    <span>Manufacturer Contact Information</span>   </h3>        <p>    <span>Unit no. 204 &amp; 205, 2nd floor, D-wing &amp; E-wing, Corporate Avenue, Andheri Ghatkopar Link Road, Mumbai, Maharashtra-400093, India For product related query call Contact Support + 91(022)69181920 or email @ info@imaginemarketingindia.com.</span>    </p>          </div>  <style type="text/css">
