</span></h5></div><span data-hook="review-date" aria-level="6" class="a-size-base a-color-secondary review-date" role="heading">Reviewed in India on 15 March 2026</span><div class="a-row a-spacing-mini review-data review-format-strip"><span data-hook="format-strip-linkless" class="a-color-secondary">Color: Black</span><i aria-hidden="true" class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="img" aria-label="|"></i><span data-hook="avp-badge-linkless" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></div><div class="a-row a-spacing-small review-data"><span data-hook="review-body" class="a-size-base review-text"><div data-a-expander-name="review_text_read_more" data-a-expander-collapsed-height="300" class="a-expander-collapsed-height a-row a-expander-container a-expander-partial-collapse-container review-text-read-more-expander" style="max-height:300px"><div data-hook="review-collapsed" data-expanded="false" class="a-expander-content reviewText review-text-content a-expander-partial-collapse-content">







  
  
    <span>I have been using these headphones for about 6 months now, and overall they are really good for the price. They are definitely value for money.<br>The battery backup is impressive with around 4-5 hours of daily use, a single charge easily lasts about 6-7 days.<br>The sound quality is also good for normal listening like music and videos.<br>The ear comfort could be a little better, especially for very long sessions.<br>For gaming, the performance is decent and works well for casual gaming. Overall, a good product for the price.<br></span>
  
</div><div class="a-expander-header a-expander-partial-collapse-header" style="opacity: 0; display: none;"><div class="a-expander-content-fade"></div><a href="javascript:void(0)" data-hook="expand-collapse-read-more-less" aria-label="Read more of this review" aria-expanded="false" role="button" data-action="a-expander-toggle" class="a-declarative" data-a-expander-toggle="{&quot;allowLinkDefault&quot;:true, &quot;expand_prompt&quot;:&quot;Read more&quot;, &quot;collapse_prompt&quot;:&quot;Read less&quot;}"><i class="a-icon a-icon-extender-expand"></i><span class="a-expander-prompt">Read more</span></a></div></div></span></div><div class="a-row cr-vote-action-bar"><span class="cr-vote" data-hook="review-voting-widget">
