                                    <div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-pqvOverlay">             <div data-cel-widget="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-content-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-slot-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-type="popup" class="a-section a-padding-none celwidget" data-csa-c-id="o9qkmf-ozcb1s-xlhzg6-uq0xv9">      <script type="text/javascript">(function(f) {var _np=(window.P._namespace("DetailPagePQVAssets"));if(_np.guardFatal){_np.guardFatal(f)(_np);}else{f(_np);}}(function(P) {
                P.now('pqv').execute(function(pqv) {
                    if (!pqv) {
                        P.register("pqv", function () {
                            return {
                                overlayType: 'desktop'
                            };
                        });
                    }
                });
            }));</script>         <h1 id="pqv-title"> Product Summary: boAt Rockerz 460 Wireless Over Ear Headphones w/Up to 30hrs Playtime, 40mm Drivers, Beast™ Mode, ENx™, Dual Pairing, BT v5.2, Instant Voice Assistant, Adaptive Fit(Crimson White) </h1>    <p id="pqv-byline">From boAt</p>               <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <p id="pqv-ratings" data-target="#averageCustomerReviews_feature_div" class="a-spacing-none">  4.1 out of 5 stars, 786 ratings </p> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-reviews-action" data-pqv-reviews-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-reviews" data-target="#customer-reviews_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.ae/boAt-Rockerz-460-Headphones-Assistant/dp/B0D5HJNQD9?ref=dp_product_quick_view#customer-reviews_feature_div"> Customer reviews </a> </span>   </div>        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-price"> Price </h2>             <p class="a-spacing-small">              <span class="a-text-bold"> One-time purchase: AED&nbsp;104.00 </span>                  </p>                                                     <p id="pqv-price-vat-message" class="a-spacing-small">  All prices include VAT.  </p>           <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buybox-action" data-pqv-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buybox" data-target="#buybox" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.ae/boAt-Rockerz-460-Headphones-Assistant/dp/B0D5HJNQD9?ref=dp_product_quick_view#buybox"> Purchasing options </a> </span> </p>                <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buying-options-action" data-pqv-buying-options-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buying-options" data-target="#dynamic-aod-ingress-box" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.ae/boAt-Rockerz-460-Headphones-Assistant/dp/B0D5HJNQD9?ref=dp_product_quick_view#dynamic-aod-ingress-box"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-unqualified-buybox-action" data-pqv-unqualified-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-unqualified-buybox" data-target="#unqualifiedBuyBox" class="a-link-normal aok-hidden" href="https://www.amazon.ae/boAt-Rockerz-460-Headphones-Assistant/dp/B0D5HJNQD9?ref=dp_product_quick_view#unqualifiedBuyBox"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p>  </div>         <div id="pqv-feature-bullets" data-target="#featurebullets_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feature-bullets-heading">About this Item</h2> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item">30 hours of Playback: Kickstart your audio fun with the boAt Rockerz 460 Wireless Headphones. Sing along to your playlist favorites on long trips for up to 30 hours as these headphones have your back.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">40 mm High-Fidelity Drivers: Powerful 40 mm drivers in these headphones are your gateway to the audio realm. boAt Signature Sound from the drivers makes visuals come alive with enthralling audio whether you are watching fast-paced action sequences or jump-scares in horror movies.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">BEAST Mode: Designed with a dedicated button to activate low-latency BEAST mode, Rockerz 460 makes gaming child’s play. Showcase your winning moves in the virtual arena without pesky lag dragging you behind.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">ENx Technology: Thanks to ENx technology, Rockerz 460 delivers your voice with high clarity amongst the cacophony. Whether you are working at home or attending calls on the go, these headphones make crystal-clear conversations a reality.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Dual Pairing: Toggle between two devices like a pro with dual pairing. Answer a call on your mobile and immediately resume binge-watching on your laptop without the hassle of reconnecting. Seamless dual pairing makes these headphones your ultimate multitasking companion!</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Bluetooth v5.2 Compatibility: Make daily commutes enjoyable with wireless Bluetooth v5.2 connectivity. Leave tangled wires behind as you escape reality with captivating sound!</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Adaptive Fit: Stay comfortably engrossed in the sound with the adaptive fit of the headband and the cushioned earcups. Game and stream for hours on end without discomfort.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Easy Access Controls: From attending calls to managing audio playback, these headphones bring all-around controls to your fingertips. Alter the volume level, hit pause on the content, end a call, and do more without reaching for your phone.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">USB Type-C Port: Juice up your Rockerz with lightning-fast charging speed regardless of the plugging orientation with the USB Type-C interface.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Easy Voice Assistant Activation: Using the Multifunction Button on your headphones, you can activate Google Voice Assistant or Siri to give your commands. Play songs, call a loved one, get match score updates, and more with just your voice.</span></li>  </ul> </div>           <div id="pqv-description" data-target="#productDescription_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <h2 id="pqv-description-heading">Product description</h2>   <div>
                    Product Description  </div>
              <div>
                    Immerse into the audio when you wear the boAt Rockerz 460 Wireless Headphones. High-fidelity 40 mm drivers make every entertainment form enjoyable with the powerful audio output. From music to movies, boAt Signature Sound takes listening to the next level by adding a punch to the audio. Unwind after a tedious day or exercise with your favorite beats for company with the extensive playtime of up to 30 hours. Not just listening, upgrade your gaming experience too with the quick-switch button for BEAST™ mode that enables low-latency gaming. Along with eliminating lag, Rockerz 460 also takes out uncomfortable wear for the utmost audio relaxation. While the headband can be modified to your convenience using adaptive fit, the plush earcups minimize pressure on your ears for uninterrupted gaming sessions with your squad. Additionally, powered by ENx™ technology, these headphones cancel background sounds for increased calling comfort. Take calls while in a car, mall, or crowded workspace without moving from your spot. Dual pairing on the other hand makes hustling through your daily tasks a breeze. Switch between attending meetings on your laptop and answering calls on your smartphone. And, do it all wirelessly with Bluetooth v5.2 connectivity. Featuring convenient control buttons, these headphones also make it easy to take calls and play or pause the audio. To tick off tasks like a pro, Rockerz 460 is integrated with voice assistant activation. Get local weather updates, open the navigation app while traveling, set reminders, and do more with voice commands.  </div>
                <div>
                    Manufacturer Contact Information  </div>
              <div>
                    Unit no. 204 &amp; 205, 2nd floor, D-wing &amp; E-wing, Corporate Avenue, Andheri Ghatkopar Link Road, Mumbai, Maharashtra-400093, India For product related query call Contact Support + 91(022)69181920 or email @ info@imaginemarketingindia.com.  </div>
